        "Separate event-method candidate: five missing physical NPC records come directly from the same pinned authored-static provider. Hakkar Essence10663 is a distinct conversion component associated with Shade of Hakkar8440; neither its level-one proxy nor a conversion is assigned kill XP. No event population, respawn timing, drop rate or numerical payout is invented. Methods still require implementation and qualification; this candidate is not active.",
